    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d136-a1">

                <pb facs="0191" n="181" sameAs="frus:frus1948v08/pg181"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Enclosure]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum by President Truman to the Secretary of Defense</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Forrestal</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1948-10-18">October 18, 1948</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>After conversations with the Director of E.C.A. and his representative in China,
                    I would suggest that the withdrawal from Tsingtao not take place at this time,
                    and that aid to North China be expedited.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Harry</hi> S. <hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">Truman</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
